    "description": "Implement the core route optimization engine that uses the trained AI models to generate optimal routes based on real-time data. The engine must provide multiple route options with different trade-offs (fastest, shortest, most reliable) and support real-time adjustments.",
    "implementationGuide": "1. Design route optimization algorithms that integrate AI predictions with graph-based routing\n2. Implement multi-objective optimization (time, distance, cost, reliability)\n3. Create route generation service with caching mechanisms\n4. Implement real-time route adjustment logic based on changing conditions\n5. Add route comparison and recommendation features\n6. Create API endpoints for route queries",
    "notes": "Use graph databases (Neo4j) for efficient route queries, implement caching strategies, ensure route feasibility.",
    "dependencies": ["AI/ML Model Development for Route Optimization"],
    "relatedFiles": [
      {
        "path": "code/route_engine.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Core route optimization engine implementation"
      },
      {
        "path": "code/route_api.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "REST API endpoints for route queries"
      },
      {
        "path": "code/route_cache.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Caching layer for route results"
      }
    ],
    "verificationCriteria": "Route optimization engine processes 1,000+ queries/second with <300ms response time. Provides 3-5 route options per query with different optimization criteria. Real-time adjustments work within 100ms of data changes. API is well-documented and tested."
  },
  {
    "name": "Real-time Monitoring and Visualization Dashboard",
    "description": "Build a real-time monitoring and visualization dashboard that displays system health, data flow, route optimization performance, and user engagement metrics. The dashboard should provide insights into system performance and help identify optimization opportunities.",
    "implementationGuide": "1. Design dashboard UI with real-time charts and metrics\n2. Implement data aggregation and reporting services\n3. Create visualization components for route optimization results\n4. Set up alerting for system anomalies and performance degradation\n5. Implement user engagement tracking and analytics\n6. Create admin interface for system configuration and monitoring",
    "notes": "Use WebSocket for real-time updates, implement responsive design, ensure data privacy.",
    "dependencies": ["Route Optimization Engine"],
    "relatedFiles": [
      {
        "path": "code/dashboard.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Real-time monitoring dashboard implementation"
      },
      {
        "path": "code/analytics.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Analytics and reporting services"
      },
      {
        "path": "frontend/dashboard.html",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Frontend dashboard interface"
      }
    ],
    "verificationCriteria": "Dashboard displays real-time metrics with <1s update frequency. All key performance indicators (KPIs) visible and actionable. Alerting system triggers appropriate notifications. Dashboard supports 10,000+ concurrent viewers."
  },
  {
    "name": "Performance Testing and Verification Framework",
    "description": "Develop a comprehensive performance testing and verification framework to ensure the system meets real-time capability requirements. This includes load testing, stress testing, latency testing, and continuous performance monitoring.",
    "implementationGuide": "1. Design test scenarios covering normal operations, peak loads, and failure conditions\n2. Implement load testing framework using JMeter or Locust\n3. Create stress testing scenarios for maximum capacity testing\n4. Implement latency testing for end-to-end response times\n5. Set up continuous performance monitoring and alerting\n6. Create performance regression testing suite",
    "notes": "Test with realistic data volumes, measure both throughput and latency, document performance baselines.",
    "dependencies": ["Real-time Monitoring and Visualization Dashboard"],
    "relatedFiles": [
      {
        "path": "code/tests/performance_test.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Performance testing framework implementation"
      },
      {
        "path": "code/tests/load_test.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Load testing scenarios and scripts"
      },
      {
        "path": "code/tests/latency_test.py",
        "type": "CREATE",
        "description": "Latency testing and measurement tools"
      }
    ],
    "verificationCriteria": "System handles 10,000+ concurrent users with <500ms average response time. Throughput meets or exceeds design targets. Performance baselines documented and monitored. All critical paths tested and verified."
  },
  {
    "name": "Deployment and DevOps Pipeline",
